<!doctype html>
<html lang="ko">
<head>
<meta charset="utf-8" />
<meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1, viewport-fit=cover" />
<title>__APP_NAME_HTML__</title>
<style>
  :root { color-scheme: dark light; }
  * { box-sizing: border-box; }
  html, body { height: 100%; margin: 0; }
  body {
    display: flex; align-items: center; justify-content: center;
    padding: 28px calc(20px + env(safe-area-inset-right)) calc(28px + env(safe-area-inset-bottom)) calc(20px + env(safe-area-inset-left));
    background: __ICON_BG__; color: #f8fafc;
    font-family: -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, "Segoe UI", "Noto Sans KR", Roboto, sans-serif;
    text-align: center;
  }
  .card { width: 100%; max-width: 360px; }
  .icon { width: 84px; height: 84px; border-radius: 22px; margin: 0 auto 18px; display: block; box-shadow: 0 10px 30px rgba(0,0,0,.35); }
  h1 { font-size: 20px; margin: 0 0 8px; letter-spacing: -0.01em; }
  p { font-size: 14px; line-height: 1.6; color: rgba(248,250,252,.72); margin: 0 0 6px; }
  code { font-size: 12px; color: rgba(248,250,252,.55); word-break: break-all; }
  button {
    margin-top: 22px; width: 100%; padding: 14px 18px; border: 0; border-radius: 14px;
    background: #f8fafc; color: #0f172a; font-size: 15px; font-weight: 700; font-family: inherit;
  }
  button:active { transform: scale(.99); }
</style>
</head>
<body>
  <main class="card">
    <img class="icon" src="icon.png" alt="" />
    <h1>__APP_NAME_HTML__</h1>
    <p>웹페이지에 연결하지 못했어요.<br />인터넷 연결을 확인하고 다시 시도해 주세요.</p>
    <code>__HOST__</code>
    <button type="button" id="retry">다시 시도</button>
  </main>
  <script>
    (function () {
      var target = __URL_JSON__;
      document.getElementById('retry').addEventListener('click', function () {
        window.location.href = target;
      });
    })();
  </script>
</body>
</html>
